Wish7990 (https://github.com/MelkhiorVintageComputing/Wish7990, commit
8610ef5): the Am7990 LANCE Ethernet core, vendored here as
rtl/sun4m/wish7990_*.sv and rtl/pkg/wish7990_pkg.sv. Upstream marks its
sources "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT" and carries no license file or
copyright line of its own; this is the MIT license those tags name.

